; caldera_temple_gate.room - the temple front before the Chamber of the Sun (design 04 section 3.7); the main path runs under the terrace.
; Verao Espacial 1 (design 02 section 8): plate (col 21) and gate (col 27) 6 cells apart on the terrace, as in summer_trial;
; Sombra on the plate opens the optional sanctum (cols 28-33). Its reward slot (`$`, WORLD-35) holds LIFE-05's fourth life note:
; "Caldera temple sanctum" (user, 2026-10-14).

